# Environment files are split by layer (nothing secret at repo root):
#
#   server/.env.development.example  →  server/.env.development
#   server/.env.production.example   →  server/.env.production
#   client/.env.development.example  →  client/.env.development
#   client/.env.production.example   →  client/.env.production
#
# See `server/.env.example` and `client/.env.example`.
